# oracle: pair_style meam/ms, the msmeam example (examples/meam/msmeam: H (dim) and Ga4 (fcc) with the HGa L12 pair, 3 atoms in an 8 A periodic box with rc = 5.9 A, periodic images inside the cutoff); energy, pressure and per-atom forces of one configuration Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): max relative error 1.4e-14 (pyy of the single configuration; pass at 1e-13, fail at 1e-14).
# oracle-inputs: w128ms_library.msmeam w128ms_HGa.msmeam
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-12 abs=1e-14 atomrel=1e-12
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p       p       p
atom_style      atomic
region          box block -4 4 -4 4 -4 4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 single 0 0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 2.2 0 0 units box
create_atoms    2 single 0.3 2.3 0 units box
mass            1 1.0079
mass            2 69.723
neighbor        1.0 bin
neigh_modify    once no every 1 delay 0 check yes
pair_style      meam/ms
pair_coeff      * * w128ms_library.msmeam H Ga4 w128ms_HGa.msmeam H Ga4
thermo_style    custom step pe press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             0
